ion</li><li>Define primary goals and success metrics</li></ol></li><li>Proposal and scope of work sign-off</li><li>Design phase<ol><li>Wireframes and user flow diagrams</li><li>High-fidelity Figma mockups</li><li>Client review and approval</li></ol></li><li>Development and testing<ol><li>Build on staging environment</li><li>QA and cross-browser testing</li></ol></li><li>Launch and handover</li></ol><h2>Unordered List Example</h2><p>The capabilities below are included across all engagement types.</p><ul><li>Custom website design and development<ul><li>Webflow builds</li><li>Insites platform builds</li></ul></li><li>Web application development<ul><li>CRM and database integrations</li><li>Admin portals and user management</li><li>API connections to third-party services</li></ul></li><li>Workflow automation<ul><li>Make, Zapier, and n8n</li><li>Custom scripting and scheduled jobs</li></ul></li><li>AI consultation and implementation</li></ul><h2>Code Example</h2><p>The snippet below shows a basic GraphQL query used to fetch a list of contacts from the Insites CRM module.</p><pre>query getContacts($page: Int, $size: Int) {\n  contacts(\n    page: $page\n    size: $size\n  ) {\n    total_entries\n    results {\n      uuid\n      first_name\n      last_name\n      email\n      job_title\n      company {\n        company_name\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}</pre><h2>Quote Example</h2><blockquote>We do not take the easy way out. Every project we take on is treated as a long-term investment in your business, not just a line item on a scope of work. The difference between good and great is in the details most agencies skip.</blockquote><p>This principle guides every engagement from first discovery call through to final handover.</p>\n",
